  "claim": "Sara Eskander Poulsen, who voiced a particular cartoon character, achieved mainstream success on The Suite Life of Zack & Cody. Vincent Martella voiced a character in this particular cartoon.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Candace Flynn. Sentence: Candace Gertrude Flynn is a main character of the Disney Channel animated television series \"Phineas and Ferb\", voiced by Ashley Tisdale and created and designed by Dan Povenmire.\nPage: Ashley Tisdale. Sentence: She achieved mainstream success as Maddie Fitzpatrick in the Disney Channel series \"The Suite Life of Zack & Cody\".\nPage: Sara Poulsen. Sentence: She is best known for voicing Candace Flynn in Phineas and Ferb and for dubbing Brenda Song's character London Tipton in The Suite Life of Zack & Cody and The Suite Life on Deck.\nPage: Vincent Martella. Sentence: He is best known for his role as Greg Wuliger on the UPN/CW sitcom \"Everybody Hates Chris\", and for the voice of Phineas Flynn in the Disney XD original animated show \"Phineas and Ferb\".",
