        "original_id": "9887fd11-0fae-5695-998d-7845e0bc52f9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Candace Flynn, Ashley Tisdale, Sara Poulsen, Vincent Martella, Dan Povenmire, Brenda Song\n- Works: Phineas and Ferb, The Suite Life of Zack & Cody, The Suite Life on Deck, Everybody Hates Chris\n- Roles: Candace Flynn, Maddie Fitzpatrick, London Tipton, Phineas Flynn, Greg Wuliger\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Povenmire created and designed Candace Gertrude Flynn for the Disney Channel animated television series Phineas and Ferb.\n- Ashley Tisdale achieved mainstream success by playing Maddie Fitzpatrick in the Disney Channel series The Suite Life of Zack & Cody.\n- Ashley Tisdale voiced Candace Gertrude Flynn, a main character in the Disney Channel animated television series Phineas and Ferb.\n- Sara Poulsen is best known for voicing Candace Flynn in Phineas and Ferb.\n- Sara Poulsen dubbed Brenda Song's character London Tipton in The Suite Life of Zack & Cody and The Suite Life on Deck.\n- Vincent Martella is best known for playing Greg Wuliger on the UPN/CW sitcom Everybody Hates Chris.\n- Vincent Martella voiced Phineas Flynn in the Disney XD original animated show Phineas and Ferb.",
